    terms; it is given here regardless.
    Licence: data/geo/LICENCE-naturalearth.txt

  - Natural Earth, Populated Places (simple), v5.1.2, 1:10m — the offline
    place-search index (all 7,342 places). Public domain, attribution given
    regardless, as above.
    Licence: data/geo/LICENCE-naturalearth.txt

  - Köppen-Geiger climate classification, present day (1991-2020), 0.1 degree.
    Beck, H.E., et al. (2023), Scientific Data 10, 724,
